# Claude Code Template Library - .gitignore Template
# Add these patterns to your project's .gitignore to protect secrets

# ============================================================================
# SECURITY: Claude Code & MCP Secrets (NEVER COMMIT)
# ============================================================================

# Claude Code local settings (project-specific)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/**/*.local.md
.claude/.env
.mcp.local.json

# Secret files (any naming pattern)
*secrets*.json
*secrets*.env
*api-keys*.json
*api-keys*.env
*credentials*.json
*credentials*.env

# ============================================================================
